<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS6" title="In Appendix B Justifications for Working Hypotheses and Empirical Support ‣ Revisiting Parameter-Based Knowledge Editing in Large Language Models: Theoretical Limits and Empirical Evidence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.6 </span>Functional Relevance: Correlation with Editing Performance</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Revisiting Parameter-Based Knowledge Editing in Large Language Models: Theoretical Limits and Empirical Evidence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Experiments and Results</span></a>
